{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're someone with no life.<br>No Memory, No life. You are absolutely nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras/title.png?t=1744914048\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your life has had it's borders realised and zoomed out<br>It makes a screen, one of which you can see the edges of. It's rubber tubing has an incessant humming; It is head splitting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You want to feel something. You NEED to feel something.<br>And you can only think of one way to accomplish that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have one want. One need. To steal the life of someone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don't care how, you don't care when, but whatever it is. Don't get yourself caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because\u2026 You want to win this game right? To unplug life from its cables and wake up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a murderer unsure of his life. His circumstances. The people around him. His everything. <br>He only has a single goal, and you're going to be complicit in that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras/Knife.png?t=1744914048\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Containing revelutionary features such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Colours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welsh People</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The &quot;7 Days&quot; Soundtrack as a guest appearance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A whole lotta murder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And bit crushed cats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras/Carlady.png?t=1744914048\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3540870?t=1744914048","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/91ed516099bffe7898cc723244429bbe8c4d0b58/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744914048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/bbeda0cc113b9a030b6a814da2880258fbcab0ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744914048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/bbeda0cc113b9a030b6a814da2880258fbcab0ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744914048","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features pretty descriptive mentions of murder and its method, whilst nothing is graphically shown descriptions are detailed"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're someone with no life.<br>No Memory, No life. You are absolutely nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras/title.png?t=1744914048\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your life has had it's borders realised and zoomed out<br>It makes a screen, one of which you can see the edges of. It's rubber tubing has an incessant humming; It is head splitting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You want to feel something. You NEED to feel something.<br>And you can only think of one way to accomplish that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have one want. One need. To steal the life of someone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don't care how, you don't care when, but whatever it is. Don't get yourself caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because\u2026 You want to win this game right? To unplug life from its cables and wake up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a murderer unsure of his life. His circumstances. The people around him. His everything. <br>He only has a single goal, and you're going to be complicit in that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras/Knife.png?t=1744914048\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Containing revelutionary features such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Colours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welsh People</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The &quot;7 Days&quot; Soundtrack as a guest appearance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A whole lotta murder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And bit crushed cats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras/Carlady.png?t=1744914048\" /></p>","developers":["Rambi_PorkChop"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/header.jpg?t=1744914048","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257099232,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099232/movie480.mp4?t=1742131658","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099232/movie_max.mp4?t=1742131658"},"name":"You are a Failed Murder Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257099232/0a38519d7beef1626880d7030fb8